      "content": "I see what you mean about the language. But looking at the actual content, both papers are addressing serious climate-related temperature changes. Do you think the difference in \"weight\" is strictly about the vocabulary, or is there something about the research methodology or the scope of the subjects being studied that makes the first one feel more fundamentally \"scientific\"?",
